<title>RUSSIA: Russian gross reserves fall in 2nd qtr.</title>
<headline>Russian gross reserves fall in 2nd qtr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's gross foreign exchange reserves fell to $15.88 billion in the second quarter from $19.25 billion in the first quarter, the central bank said on Friday in its latest bulletin.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN RESERVES ($ million)    Jul 1, 96   Apr 1, 96  Jul 1, 95</p>
<p>    Reserve assets of central bank 15,877	19,248     12,412</p>
<p>	Monetary gold		     3,085	 2,917	2,327</p>
<p>	SDRs				    139	   256	  227</p>
<p>	Reserve position at IMF	     1	     1	    1</p>
<p>	Other currency reserves	12,652	16,074	9,857</p>
<p>NOTE - Central bank reserve assets include finance ministry assets. Gold is valued at $300 an ounce.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
